# This keeps your local cache and junk out of everyone else's clone.
# =======================================================
# Release copies are separate, history-free distributions, not source files.
/dist/
# Private development material. Already-tracked files remain in Git history;
# use tools/public-review for publication, never change this checkout's visibility.
/docs/OpenCTI-Transfer-Plan.md
/docs/GTI-Data-Structures.md
/docs/GTI-OpenCTI-Backend-Plan.md
/docs/design-system/
/.openai/
# Local app configs
# Named explicitly rather than as `.*` — that pattern matched `.gitignore`
# itself and `.github/`, so neither could ever be committed.
.claude/
.codex
.obsidian/
.remember/
AGENTS.md
# =======================================================
# Local cache
tools/gtidocs-mirror/.cache/
/docs/Resources/tools/gtidocs-mirror/.cache/
/graphify-out
# =======================================================
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# =======================================================

